message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "GC-FID HDO Calculator GUI"
abstract:
  A PyQt6 desktop application for extracting Front Signal peak tables from
  GC-FID PDF reports, filtering compounds by retention time, applying
  calibration curves, and generating conversion, selectivity, Pearson
  correlation, and carbon recovery outputs for hydrodeoxygenation datasets.
